cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Foldline, please cite it as below. Please also credit LemoLab for lemo-opuscar, which Foldline builds on."
type: software
title: "Foldline"
abstract: "Renders HTML canvas animations to H.264 MP4 fast on a Mac, by encoding inside headless Chrome with WebCodecs on the hardware encoder. Ships the full lemo-opuscar library of 66 film styles made in code."
authors:
